
sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Main
    participant NS as NetworkService
    participant AM as AuthManager
    participant TC as TmddCodec
    participant DR as DataRepository
    participant DC as DeviceController
    participant CM as ConfigManager
    
    Note over M,CM: System Startup
    M->>CM: load_config(config.xml)
    CM-->>M: return mode (Normal/Test)
    M->>DR: connect(traffic.db)
    DR-->>M: connection established
    M->>NS: start()
    NS->>NS: listen TCP/IP port
    
    Note over M,DC: Incoming TMDD Message
    NS->>NS: on_message_received(raw_data)
    NS->>TC: decode_tmdd(raw_data)
    TC-->>NS: return parsed_data
    NS->>AM: authenticate(user, pass)
    AM-->>NS: return true/false
    alt Authentication Success
        NS->>DR: store_traffic_data(parsed_data)
        DR-->>NS: data stored
        NS->>NS: send_response(ACK)
    else Authentication Failed
        NS->>NS: send_response(NACK)
        NS->>DR: log_activity(Auth Failure)
    end
    
    Note over M,DC: Remote Device Control (GUI)
    DC->>AM: authenticate(operator, pass)
    AM-->>DC: return true
    DC->>CM: is_test_mode()
    CM-->>DC: return false
    DC->>DC: execute_command(DMS_01, SET_MSG)
    DC->>DR: log_activity(Command Sent)
    DR-->>DC: logged
